{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0HA6", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$S$", "MATH_0003": "$f$", "MATH_0004": "$X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-type-excellent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:635d23937ffcdd9088854c43c7a115df298f870b71ec00f19152da46121edffe", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:59d4dad0e6c27877bc7db66b8df1d1647f43625ba2003cbffee816047ff8a917", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism.\nIf <MATH_0002> is (quasi-)excellent and <MATH_0003> locally of finite type then\n<MATH_0004> is (quasi-)excellent.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:988eb4b59ce7b6ba549456f49af7c58a76dba1b6ccca6a87069cbbc8e6a5163d", "unit_id": "tag:0HAC:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0HA6", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{more-algebra-lemma-finite-type-over-excellent}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:75951f0b34f9b8c2f223dea600e79d98fb8994a4f0f49d74c190d73fce301beb", "source_text": "See More on Algebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c8b357af5630b1a5d08780c2b7b8a8f960b1a0f8278839de7ac7f47c2d9d4e1b", "unit_id": "tag:0HAC:proof"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "0HA6", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathbf{Z}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\item", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-ubiquity-excellent}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ce27841503e12e6f65ff4227a2873a91c0b2ca140a4ec8c562a0bff31b2b3d9b", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a2d624ffb3ff9fb5aeaa32d96462bde5280bddfc8eee91fc1baf760f6b015dda", "source_text": "The following types of schemes are excellent.\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> Any scheme locally of finite type over a field.\n<STRUCT_0003> Any scheme locally of finite type over a Noetherian complete local ring.\n<STRUCT_0004> Any scheme locally of finite type over <MATH_0001>.\n<STRUCT_0005> Any scheme locally of finite type over a Dedekind ring of\ncharacteristic zero.\n<STRUCT_0006>\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9b03cb685bec8caba1fb89beb036560a6799fed5c17eed92d87f90f4b3f167b1", "unit_id": "tag:0HAD:statement"}
{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "0HA6", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-locally-excellent}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{lemma-finite-type-excellent}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{more-algebra-proposition-ubiquity-excellent}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:334e5410f1ef4df96300b3e4673971f0957204d0db7a3a776a8333f5ac4347c3", "source_text": "By Lemmas <REF_0001> and <REF_0002>\nwe only need to show that the rings mentioned above are excellent.\nFor this see\nMore on Algebra, Proposition <REF_0003>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:34387543655248afade5cf770ddfb0d753f6027c621fccbad59d47e785284672", "unit_id": "tag:0HAD:proof"}
